      "writtenOn": "2024-04-12T12:14:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would add that we plan to migrate all boards to Zephyr, perform deshimming and finally cut our connections with EC. I believe we will drop fingerprint specific EC unit tests at some point in future.\n\n\u003e We\u0027ve discussed it with Patryk and decided it is a better way\n\nI was more radical. My opinion was that we should abandon EC style (compile whole firmware + test code) and implement tests in Zephyr style (compiling only necessary things + test code). For example, `system_is_locked` test doesn\u0027t really need FPSENSOR code, BoringSSL, matching algorithm, etc.",
      "parentUuid": "ec03d7ab_654fd5b1",
      "revId": "80b270c70870cbf830a1141eb4c157e0ebb2a899",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
